# Petzo API — run with the VS Code REST Client or IntelliJ HTTP client.
# Pick the environment in http-client.env.json (local / production). {{token}} = accessToken from /api/auth/login.

### Health
GET {{api}}/actuator/health

### Register (the API calls Supabase Auth; clients never do)
POST {{api}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "andreina.demo@example.com", "password": "una-clave-de-prueba", "fullName": "Andreína Márquez"}

### Login → {accessToken, refreshToken, expiresIn}
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "andreina.demo@example.com", "password": "una-clave-de-prueba"}

### Refresh
POST {{api}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refreshToken": "REPLACE"}

### Google: open in a browser; the API redirects to Google and back to `redirect` without tokens, then POST /claim
# GET {{api}}/api/auth/google/start?flow=<uuid>&challenge=<base64url(sha256(secret))>&redirect=http://localhost:5173/auth-callback

### Google claim (one-time, 5 min)
POST {{api}}/api/auth/google/claim
Content-Type: application/json

{"flow": "REPLACE-UUID", "secret": "REPLACE-SECRET"}

### Municipalities (public)
GET {{api}}/api/municipalities

### Catalog (public; size accepts a comma list)
GET {{api}}/api/pets?species=dog&size=small,medium&ageMin=0&ageMax=60&page=1

### Pet detail (public if approved)
GET {{api}}/api/pets/{{petId}}

### Me
GET {{api}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Complete profile
PUT {{api}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"fullName": "Andreína Márquez", "whatsapp": "0414 987 6543", "municipalityId": 3}

### Foundation request
POST {{api}}/api/me/foundation-request
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"foundationName": "Refugio Patas del Ávila", "foundationInstagram": "@patasdelavila", "foundationBio": "Rescatamos perros en Libertador"}

### Create pet (draft, respects plan limit; D-28)
POST {{api}}/api/pets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"species": "dog", "name": "Toby", "ageMonths": 14, "sex": "male", "size": "medium", "municipalityId": 2, "vaccinated": true, "sterilized": true, "dewormed": false, "description": "Tranquilo en casa y feliz en la calle."}

### Upload one photo (JPEG ≤ 2 MB) through the API → {path}; it joins the gallery with PUT /photos
POST {{api}}/api/pets/{{petId}}/photos/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=petzo

--petzo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="toby.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ../src/main/resources/static/demo/img/toby.jpg
--petzo--

### Save the whole gallery in order (first = cover; 1 to 5 paths; kept paths stay, missing ones are deleted)
PUT {{api}}/api/pets/{{petId}}/photos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"paths": ["pets/{{petId}}/REPLACE.jpg"]}

### Submit the draft for moderation
PATCH {{api}}/api/pets/{{petId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "pending_review"}

### Delete a draft (new or imported from Instagram); 409 for any other status
DELETE {{api}}/api/pets/{{petId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pause / republish / adopted
PATCH {{api}}/api/pets/{{petId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "paused"}

### My pets
GET {{api}}/api/me/pets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Favorite
POST {{api}}/api/favorites/{{petId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Report
POST {{api}}/api/pets/{{petId}}/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "Fotos de internet"}

### Adoption request (AI pre-evaluation runs async)
POST {{api}}/api/pets/{{petId}}/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"answers": {"vivienda": "Casa", "otrasMascotas": "No"}, "motivation": "Tengo patio grande y tiempo para pasearlo cada día."}

### Requests for my pet (owner)
GET {{api}}/api/pets/{{petId}}/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Approve request
POST {{api}}/api/requests/{{requestId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### WhatsApp contact (only after approval)
GET {{api}}/api/requests/{{requestId}}/contact
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Lifestyle questionnaire
PUT {{api}}/api/me/lifestyle
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"housing": "apartamento", "timeAtHome": "medio", "kids": false, "otherPets": true, "experience": "algo"}

### AI match
POST {{api}}/api/match
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"species": "cat"}

### Admin: moderation queue
GET {{api}}/api/admin/moderation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: approve / reject (reject deletes photos)
POST {{api}}/api/admin/pets/{{petId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason": "Las fotos aparecen en otras páginas de internet."}

### Admin: stats
GET {{api}}/api/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: launch Instagram import
POST {{api}}/api/admin/imports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"instagramHandle": "@patasdelavila"}

### Internal (n8n): moderation result
POST {{api}}/internal/pets/{{petId}}/moderation-result
x-internal-secret: {{internalSecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"riskScore": 12, "reason": "Fotos propias y descripción coherente", "updatedAt": null, "inputTokens": 900, "outputTokens": 60}
